Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.49,0:00:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.07,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.57,0:01:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place that\Nthe end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary till\Nsomeone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, through\Nall the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.17,0:01:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.13,0:01:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.37,0:01:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(686,727,\1a&H00&)}Chivalry vs. Fishman Karate
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.03,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(727,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Chivalry vs. Fishman Karate
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.45,0:01:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you're having a\Nreally bad day or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.21,0:02:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already demonstrated my way of the\NSix Blades to these pathetic humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there's no way you can hope\Nto defeat me in that condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.99,0:02:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just shut up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, he's taken such a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unsure the onset of fever caused by his\Nwounds is making him delirious, or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that wound opens up again,\NI'm afraid he'll die for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't have time to\Nthink about that right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.33,0:02:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's the only one who\Ncan fight that six-sword freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.99,0:02:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yosaku, Johnny, lend me your swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:40.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, catch! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much longer I can last.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll understand why two human\Nhands never have a chance to beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.37,0:02:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:56.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:02:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentacle sword overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Streaming wolf swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He faced all six swords,\Nand not even a scratch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.81,0:03:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect sword skill, with\Nperfect concentration!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you cut me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.41,0:03:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you'll\Nsurvive my next attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just got lucky is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat my six\Nswords with your three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have twice as many swords as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.95,0:03:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was never very good at math.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What weight do you\Ncarry on your shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.01,0:04:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have more swords than me, but mine\Nwill always carry more weight than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only been drowned for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can get him back\Nup, we can revive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't swing hard enough\Nunderwater to break this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.73,0:04:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Conis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.11,0:04:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.51,0:04:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs oxygen now, but there's\Nno time to get an air canister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't carry him up with this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weight, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may not look like it, but my\Nswords actually weigh quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over 300 pounds each, to be exact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.23,0:05:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weigh much more than\Nyour pathetic human swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I meant the burden of... Oh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.29,0:05:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weigh of six swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Octopus Pot Stance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Year's!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.49,0:05:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Body slam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.97,0:05:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame shot! Stupid octopus! How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.25,0:05:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.77,0:05:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never touch the ground alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waltz of six swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.07,0:05:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be mid-speed if you\Ntouch debris for even a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.43,0:05:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.07,0:05:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First you timed your roll to\Ndodge my tentacle sword overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:06:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you slice and dice my hands\Nup like some cheap sushi chef!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you make a spectacle\Nof my master swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.19,0:06:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.31,0:06:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you limb from\Nlimb. Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That attack it probably\Nopened up his wounds again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I wish I could\Ntake his place right now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if this wound\Nwould kill a normal man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not allowed to fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way of six swords octopus pot\Nstands time to die sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot feel the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Year's!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm ever going to face Hawkeye as\Nan equal, I must be extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.63,0:06:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.07,0:07:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Archie, defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fish, now you finally understand the\Nweight I carry in my three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now the\Ntentacles is out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's time to go rescue Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.89,0:08:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you'd gotten rid of me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.07,0:08:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was\Nanyone in all of the East
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.73,0:08:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue who could stand back up\Nafter one of my punches. Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.73,0:08:13.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.07,0:08:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At a certain restaurant\NI know of. Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead if you go\Nin the water like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't last much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.09,0:08:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you ladies might\Nwant to stop chatting?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I could get you to\Nshut up for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.19,0:08:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe you would have noticed\Nthat I was about to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.87,0:08:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.39,0:08:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to try his luck in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Against the fish man! Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I told you, they want\Nus to fight in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man is from Cocoyashi Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've stretched out Luffy's neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.15,0:09:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but this is\Nthe best I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,please try to breathe\Nplease come back damn it I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.69,0:09:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't hold my breath much\Nlonger you have to come
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.45,0:09:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,back now I see I couldn't\Nmove the stone so they
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.05,0:09:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just moved Luffy's head above\Nthe water. All I have to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do is break the rock apart\Nin the situation should
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take care of itself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.69,0:09:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is more like somebody else
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.87,0:09:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something entertaining.\NIt's that old man from
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:10:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the village what a waste\Nof time damn it he sees me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,such a pathetic attempt\Ntrying to keep rubber
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy alive, I guess I'll just kill you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.79,0:10:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where do you think you're\Ngoing you foolish human
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you really trying to fight me underwater\Nyou can't even breathe down here what
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.67,0:10:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,makes you think you can fight as you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,foolish boy fishman\Nkarate dueling hair cover
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too bad your kick is powerless down here
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's more of your human weakness but my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fish man karate loses nothing in water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quite the contrary it's much more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:11:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishman Karate: Underwater Ladder Buster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bishman Karate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flaming Axe Kick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back Foot Jawbreaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.61,0:11:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Air, air, air!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let out too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, let me through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.15,0:12:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.65,0:12:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have amazing stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure you're human?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me through now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say something like, any man\Nwho hurts a lady is just a piece of crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, look at what your precious\Nlove of women has finally gotten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no escape and you'll die by\Nmy hand. The old man and the boy he's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to save they'll die too i'll\Nkill zoro and the long-nosed guy then
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll massacre the entire village and\Nas my final pleasure i'll murder that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traitorous bitch nami don't you see your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love is worthless. If it can't save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you protect no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even your little girlfriend, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that you have some skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, in the end,\Nyou're just a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your body doesn't react well to a\Nsudden change in pressure, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a theory about what's\Ngoing to happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your organs are going to\Nexplode from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulverizing pressure plunge!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I want to save Nami, the first\Nthing I have to do is save myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll just have to try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fishmen use their lungs\Nto breathe air on land,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they use their gills\Nto breathe water down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means a fish's gills\Nare useless on dry land.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for your second Grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their lungs are useless underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.19,0:14:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means forcing air into his\Ngills should suffocate this bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't worry, he's okay? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, half of him. Wait,\Nhalf. I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First get your ass up here I want\Nto fight where I can breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.85,0:15:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me if\NI'm on land or in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just as strong either way now you will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,witness the true power of fishman karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.29,0:15:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I punched you before that was\Njust a sample of things to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate attack is\Nten times as powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the chances you'll\Nsurvive it are zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said my love was worthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.39,0:15:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.97,0:15:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't protect anyone, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:16:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rips! Back! Chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.43,0:16:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thousand Tiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.11,0:16:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, face shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.49,0:16:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.23,0:17:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caribou?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.13,0:17:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.37,0:17:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, they're all just seafood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fish can't fight a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This game is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.41,0:17:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've killed my brothers\None after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.43,0:17:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I've let you\Nget too carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's half-okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means he's alive for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we want him fully back on dry\Nland, I've got to go back in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something tells me ugly\Nover there won't let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:18:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys beat two of\NArlong's best fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hold my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my place. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spit out a bunch of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I miss anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.77,0:18:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I have hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.57,0:18:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys have fought so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.21,0:18:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may actually be set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chew, what a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That long-nosed freak\Nsure could run forever
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.87,0:18:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it took just one blast from my\NWater Gun to take him out completely
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I should head back.\NIt's all over by now for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked, I'm alive I'm so glad I made\Nthe ketchup star for such occasions
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks he killed me with a\Nwater blast Run along now, go home
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.69,0:19:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are totally freaking nuts.\NI don't even know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they destroyed an entire\Nvillage and killed everyone in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it i know nami can't do this\Nall on her own but seriously
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm hearing things i don't mind hiding\Nfrom death death is scary let's see i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.03,0:19:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,covered in fake blood but i need to look a\Nlittle more beat up like i fought bravely
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey i know what's\Nmissing dirt yeah huh too
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clean hey i'm sorry i\Ngot lost yeah that's good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no i did my best but he got me maybe i was
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:19:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this close to the bastard\Nand he got away Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.79,0:19:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that sounds better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it sounds like I'm trying too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're friends, right? So get on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all did the very best we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.61,0:20:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never in my life did I imagine it lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody fought very bravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth is that our idiot captain is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.17,0:20:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far better than a gang\Nwho'd prey on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I nearly died myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.21,0:20:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was my only choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.19,0:20:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, my\Ninjuries aren't bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.62,0:20:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Nami was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they need any more reason than\Nthat to put their lives on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To make a choice like\Nthat when you're only ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how hard that\Nmust have been for Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:21:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought bravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.91,0:21:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still alive, Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, big lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.23,0:21:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes more than water\Nto kill someone like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I left home, I\Nleft everything behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.81,0:21:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you live your life on the edge\Nyou savor every moment that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.47,0:21:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're able to laugh so much that's\Nthe reason I went to sea I want to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:22:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that way too if I don't fight with\Nall I got then I don't deserve to be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the same ship as them and I'll\Nnever be able to face my friends again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.51,0:22:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool, you were better off\Npretending to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.29,0:22:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The human brain is an\Nabsolute waste of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.85,0:22:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.75,0:22:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.53,0:22:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp hammer! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp rubber band of doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chew?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.65,0:22:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did that stupid son of a bitch go?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.25,0:22:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.85,0:23:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saki? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the only way you\Ncan fight, you coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no place to hide\Nfrom my squirt cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid coward or whatever,\NI can't run from this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although it doesn't really feel\Nall that great to be manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I lose, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.59,0:23:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I'll die a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.09,0:23:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squirt cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.31,0:23:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, why should I have to\Nwaste my time with such an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.85,0:23:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll shred you to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.95,0:23:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Squirt machine gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.23,0:24:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, crap, holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a real pirate, and\Nnow that I've finally got my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.93,0:24:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can do it! I\Nknow I can! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.51,0:24:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I survive this ordeal, I'll never\Npretend to be a pirate ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.25,0:24:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be a coward and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.87,0:24:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fake pirate days are over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:24.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say is done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.97,0:24:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alcohol lights on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.39,0:24:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, flaming star!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.13,0:24:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.17,0:24:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.41,0:24:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.24,0:24:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water! Must find water! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.93,0:24:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! Water! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.57,0:24:47.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?! Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.69,0:24:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.59,0:25:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BASTARD!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.93,0:25:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp! Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.31,0:25:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.99,0:25:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that loser?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.95,0:25:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.71,0:25:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.41,0:25:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's a pirate now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.77,0:25:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Usopp the Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.77,0:26:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch the sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.49,0:26:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I began to wonder What could be\Nthe reason it's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.77,0:26:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.53,0:26:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings,\Nget them to come back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be, because\Nthey're everything I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.27,0:26:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pass these arms around my dreams\Nand pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.97,0:26:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way.

